[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0010","text":"呼……怎么样？\n朝日──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0020","text":"──你什么时候练得这么厉害的！？\n跟我之前看到的时候完全不一样──好厉害！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0030","text":"啊～\n那个～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0040","text":"──其实啊，为了给朝日酱一个惊喜\n我跟冬优子酱两个人偷偷加练了哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0050","text":"托这个福，冬优我们也没什么工作\n练习的时间倒是多得很"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0060","text":"啊哈哈，吓到了吧！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0070","text":"……这里……是这样的感觉……\n啊哈哈，好难啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0080","text":"……那个舞步，你知道我练了多久才学会的吗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0090","text":"……果然不是盖的\n朝日酱……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0100","text":"……我一直都知道的，冬优我们根本追不上你\n而且，甚至都放弃了去追赶"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0110","text":"被那家伙说了才想起来，冬优我到底想做什么\n冬优我啊，是要成为顶级偶像的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0120","text":"你什么的，不过是通往那个目标途中的一个站点罢了\n在输给冬优我之前，别想从那个位置上下来"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0130","text":"……我啊，跟你们俩比起来，不管是意识还是实力\n都还差得远呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0140","text":"但是，看着你们俩，我就觉得想努力到能做到的极限！\n所以啊，首先要好好追上你们！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0150","text":"然后……\n再超越你们！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0013","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0014","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0160","text":"……说得倒是轻巧\n什么追上啊超越的──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0170","text":"──真能做到吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0015","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0022","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0016","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0180","text":"…………我是不会输的……\n我们，是不会输给任何人的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0017","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0190","text":"——……我们是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0018","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0019","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_06_0200","text":"……Straylight——！"}]
